1
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,628
She's ours!

2
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:39,304
She's ours, hunter! She's ours!

3
00:00:43,972 --> 00:00:46,318
No. She's not. 

4
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:09,000
Take your time. I'm not going anywhere.
Wasn't planning to hurry. 

5
00:01:14,496 --> 00:01:16,052
You're not from the salt.
No. 

6
00:01:16,550 --> 00:01:19,218
They want you alive. Double.
Of course they do. 

7
00:01:22,131 --> 00:01:23,693
Ask me what I took.
I don't care what you took. 

8
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:25,840
Ask me anyway.
What did you take. 

9
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,840
Nothing. I've never stolen anything in my life. 

10
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:30,927
I was at a dig site. Nine days 
ago. That's all I did. I was there. 

11
00:01:35,103 --> 00:01:36,742
Do you have her.
Kane: I have her. 

12
00:01:37,004 --> 00:01:38,360
Alive.
Alive. 

13
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:43,040
Good. The convoy she robbed 
lost eleven people, Kane. 

14
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,756
Eleven.
Don't let her talk to you. 

15
00:01:46,565 --> 00:01:48,397
Kane.
Copy. 

16
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:59,200
They fell. Nobody built those. 

17
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:03,840
We built them. To kill each other. And it worked.
Then who built the ones in the north? 

18
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,721
Same hands.
Different hands. 

19
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:11,520
Eleven people. Is that what he told you?
Don't. 

20
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:16,716
There were four of us at that site. Four.
Nobody died, Kane. Nobody died at all. 

21
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:32,609
Kane! There's someone behind us!
He's gaining! Kane, he's right on us! 

22
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,248
I know. 

23
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,880
Left! The crust is dead there!
How do you know that? 

24
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,560
Because I've walked it!

25
00:02:58,652 --> 00:02:59,759
Hold on!

26
00:03:23,057 --> 00:03:23,882
Kane...

27
00:03:29,401 --> 00:03:30,321
Get up!

28
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:50,000
You knew he was lying.
I know now. 

29
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,000
Why?
Because he sent someone to kill me. 

30
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:10,867
That's been there all morning.
It's been there a thousand years. 

31
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:36,000
It's not scared of you.
It's scared of something else. 

32
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,240
What is that. 

33
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,728
It doesn't even see us. 

34
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,647
Kane. Report.

35
00:05:40,235 --> 00:05:41,696
Nobody knows why they woke up. 

36
00:05:42,235 --> 00:05:44,640
Everybody's decided they know. That's worse. 

37
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,000
Kane.

38
00:05:49,505 --> 00:05:50,179
Kane. 

39
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:52,973
Kane.

40
00:06:04,318 --> 00:06:05,753
Send another one.

